      ],
      "schedule": [
        {
          "time": "08:05",
          "text": "Proposed Southwest WN 954: BWI 08:05 → AUS 10:55. Choice fare previously quoted $1,868 for 4 adults + 1 lap infant round trip (~$467 per paying adult). Not booked; reprice the full group. Standard seat choice + carry-on; checked bags extra.",
