          "text": "Flexible grocery stop and downtime before check-in. Early Airbnb access is not confirmed; keep the pre-check-in period flexible around the babies.",
          "type": "note",
          "id": "d1-item4"
        },
        {
          "time": "16:00",
          "text": "Check in to your selected Airbnb: 5 bedrooms, 4 baths, 6 beds across both duplex units; two kitchens and two living rooms. Check-in listed 16:00–23:00; checkout by 10:00.",
          "type": "check-in",
          "ticketIds": [
            "stay"
          ],
          "id": "d1-item5"
        },
        {
          "time": "18:00",
          "text": "Easy dinner at home or nearby. Unpack, put your feet up, and call it a win.",
          "type": "rest",
          "id": "d1-item6"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "All times are local. Austin is one hour behind DC in November.",
        "Group: 8+ adults and two toddlers around 16–17 months. Final headcount to confirm.",
        "Suggested rooms: babies with parents in the downstairs king/queen rooms; third family upstairs king; cousins share remaining rooms. Verify crib availability and room layout with host before booking.",
        "Alternative flight: United IAD 08:30 → AUS 11:19 previously found; flight number and return still to confirm. Nonbasic round-trip search lead was $2,116 for 4 adults + 1 lap infant, not a final itinerary."
      ]
