        },
        {
          "time": "09:15–10:15",
          "text": "Mount Bonnell: short climb, Lake Austin views, and photos. Free entry and parking. 102 stone steps or a rough gravel trail; use baby carriers, not strollers.",
          "type": "attraction",
          "placeId": "bonnell",
          "ticketIds": [
            "bonnell-info"
          ],
          "id": "d2-item2"
        },
        {
          "time": "10:15–11:15",
          "text": "Return toward the house. Families settle in while one or two adults collect lunch.",
          "type": "rest",
          "id": "d2-item3"
        },
        {
          "time": "11:30–12:15",
          "text": "Target Franklin preorder pickup 11:30–12:00, then lunch at home. Minimum 5 lb; slots open 56 days ahead and are not held. Suggested order: 3 lb brisket + 1 lb ribs + 1 lb sausage + 3 pints of sides. Previously about $225 with tax, before tip.",
          "type": "restaurant",
          "placeId": "franklin",
          "ticketIds": [
            "franklin-order"
          ],
          "id": "d2-item4"
        },
        {
          "time": "13:00–15:30",
          "text": "Nap time for the tiny crew; free time for everyone else. Coffee, a couch, or a solo wander—your call.",
          "type": "rest",
          "id": "d2-item5"
        },
        {
          "time": "16:00–19:00",
          "text": "A little neighborhood stroll if you feel like it, then a light dinner. Save room for the evening.",
          "type": "rest",
          "id": "d2-item6"
        },
        {
          "time": "20:30",
          "text": "Cousins’ optional cocktail night at The Roosevelt Room. Request a reservation; 307 W 5th St. Budget $45–70 per adult for two cocktails with tax/tip (estimate). Rideshare from the house.",
          "type": "restaurant",
          "placeId": "roosevelt",
          "ticketIds": [
            "roosevelt-book"
          ],
          "id": "d2-item7"
        },
        {
          "time": "22:30",
          "text": "Optional second stop: The White Horse, 500 Comal St, for live country music and two-stepping. 21+; walk-in and variable cover. Budget $25–50 (estimate). Rideshare home when ready.",
          "type": "restaurant",
          "placeId": "whitehorse",
          "ticketIds": [
            "whitehorse-info"
          ],
          "id": "d2-item8"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "The bar outing is optional; families can stay home. Both minivans stay parked for the drinking group.",
        "Rainy or slippery at Mount Bonnell? Skip the climb. Extra coffee time is a perfectly good plan."
      ]
    },
