          "text": "Easy lunch at home. For the serious BBQ fans: Interstellar preorder collected by a couple of adults. $120 minimum and at least 72 hours notice; no indoor seating for preorders. Keep the babies’ day local.",
          "type": "restaurant",
          "ticketIds": [
            "interstellar-order"
          ],
          "id": "d3-item2"
        },
        {
          "time": "13:00–15:00",
          "text": "Recharge time. Naps for the little ones, a slow afternoon for the rest of us.",
          "type": "rest",
          "id": "d3-item3"
