          "text": "The Oasis on Lake Travis: early dinner, drinks, and sunset views. Aim for 16:00–16:15 arrival, 60–90 minutes before sunset (~17:34). Main dining is walk-in; a view table for ten is not guaranteed. Be willing to split into nearby tables.",
